  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A cell has an emf of 17.0 V and internal resistance r. It is connected to two 10 Ω external resistors.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>There is a current of 1.5 A in one of the external resistors.</p>\n<p>What is the value of r?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">0.34 Ω</li><li data-label=\"B\">0.50 Ω</li><li data-label=\"C\">0.67 Ω</li><li data-label=\"D\">1.3 Ω</li></ol>"
  },
